Centre the HOD4 shake sensors, add a shake button and start axes at their position in evdev mode

In evdev mode initSdlInput() returns before it centres the House of the
Dead 4 shake sensors (ANALOGUE_5-8), and the per-frame shake update never
runs. With a pad nothing maps them, so they read 0, the game sees the gun
shaking and every shot reloads. Centre them in initEvdevControllers().

Pads have no motion sensor, so a button can be mapped as
<device>:KEY:<code>:SHAKE to ANALOGUE_5 or ANALOGUE_7. Held, it reads
as shaking on both of that player's sensors, released as still.

A stick resting in its centre also sends no events until it moves, so
the gun sits at 0,0 (off-screen). Read each mapped axis when the
controller thread starts.

